{% extends 'base.html.j2' %}
{% from 'components.html.j2' import eyebrow, faq, cta with context %}
{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero wrap"><div>{{ eyebrow('YOUR THAILAND VISA DESK') }}<h1>The right visa starts<br>with <em><mark class="hl">your life.</mark></em></h1><p>Remote work, retirement, family or a new opportunity. Compare every route on one page, see what each one asks of you, and skip the hours of forum threads.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="{{ url('tools/visa-finder/') }}">Find my visa in 2 minutes {{ icon('arrow') }}</a><a class="text-link" href="{{ url('contact/') }}">Talk to our desk {{ icon('arrow') }}</a></div></div><div class="page-hero-note">{{ icon('passport') }}<h2>Your purpose.<br>Your evidence.<br>Your next step.</h2><p>A route comparison helps you ask better questions. The authorities decide eligibility.</p></div></section>
<section class="section soft-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div>{{ eyebrow('COMPARE YOUR OPTIONS') }}<h2>Different routes.<br>Different reasons to come.</h2></div><p>Start with the closest fit.<br>Check the details for your circumstances.</p></div><div class="visa-grid">{% for visa in visas %}<article class="visa-card"><div class="visa-card-top">{{ icon(visa.icon) }}<span class="tag">{{ visa.badge }}</span></div><h3>{{ visa.short }}</h3><p class="visa-label">{{ visa.label }}</p><p>{{ visa.summary }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ url('visas/' ~ visa.slug ~ '/') }}">Explore this route {{ icon('arrow') }}</a></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section class="section compact-section related-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div>{{ eyebrow('MORE ROUTES AND RULES') }}<h2>Family, work, short stays<br>and staying legal.</h2></div><p>The routes people ask about next.<br>Plus the rules that apply once you are here.</p></div><div class="related-grid">{% for slug in ['visas/family','visas/work-permit','visas/tourist-and-visa-exemption','visas/permanent-residence','stay-legal','tools/visa-finder'] %}{% set guide = pages_by_slug[slug] %}<a class="related-card" href="{{ url(slug ~ '/') }}"><span class="eyebrow">{{ guide.get('eyebrow') or 'FREE TOOL' }}</span><h2>{{ guide.get('short') or guide.heading|striptags }}</h2><p>{{ guide.description|truncate(118) }}</p><span class="text-link">{{ 'Open the finder' if slug.startswith('tools') else 'Read the guide' }} {{ icon('arrow') }}</span></a>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow">{{ eyebrow('COMPARE BEFORE YOU COMMIT') }}<h2>A clear route review<br>answers four questions.</h2><ol class="number-list"><li><strong>Does it fit what I intend to do?</strong><p>Work, study, family and leisure are different purposes.</p></li><li><strong>Can I provide the evidence?</strong><p>Use the current requirements of the authority handling your application.</p></li><li><strong>What is the full cost?</strong><p>Separate official fees, service fees and third-party costs.</p></li><li><strong>What happens after arrival?</strong><p>Know the length of permission, conditions and next deadlines.</p></li></ol></div></section>
{{ faq(faqs) }}{{ cta() }}
{% endblock %}

